                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8aa832c8-8f7b-3553-a7b3-821079d6dbd4",
                        "entry_id": "5aecf1a2-56f1-32ba-89e6-745dc12a6f07",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clipping of negative."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "clipping",
                            "rhetoric"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9a06b3bb-8e0b-3b7f-9b29-b194062b3416",
                        "entry_id": "5aecf1a2-56f1-32ba-89e6-745dc12a6f07",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An expression or implication that one has a negative value judgement of someone in order to make them desire one's approval, especially when trying to pick up a date."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "93200f72-6b5d-44af-af0e-7d57b8a83dab",
                                "sense_id": "9a06b3bb-8e0b-3b7f-9b29-b194062b3416",
                                "text": "The purpose of a neg is to lower a woman's self esteem while actively displaying a lack of interest in her—by telling her she has lipstick on her teeth, for example, or offering her a piece of gum after she speaks."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e232a3ea-1ccc-40f1-8ccd-ca93bd410ec4",
                                "sense_id": "9a06b3bb-8e0b-3b7f-9b29-b194062b3416",
                                "text": "A neg is not an insult but a negative social value judgment that is telegraphed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "819c74a4-f77a-4156-a4fd-31156c887f2e",
                                "sense_id": "9a06b3bb-8e0b-3b7f-9b29-b194062b3416",
                                "text": "As we sped down Lake Michigan Drive, I was still feeling a little star-struck and decided that on account of her uber-hot looks, I'd need to start launching negs at her like there was no tomorrow."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c797b754-dd31-40a4-b999-36c0b9694aa1",
                                "sense_id": "9a06b3bb-8e0b-3b7f-9b29-b194062b3416",
                                "text": "Negs include asking whether her nails are real, or saying that you saw someone else wearing her skirt."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0a62df58-4141-3a75-968a-69d1a3f5e4ac",
                        "entry_id": "5aecf1a2-56f1-32ba-89e6-745dc12a6f07",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a penalty for giving an incorrect answer before a tossup has been fully read."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": [
