                        ],
                        "form": "negged"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "581ce2e4-8863-3767-a9ef-932584d44e9b",
                        "entry_id": "864b074e-bec0-3795-833e-cba914eee9c4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To annoy or irritate deliberately."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "British",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad2a4339-6131-32cb-9c7a-53bf31b67c6f",
                        "entry_id": "864b074e-bec0-3795-833e-cba914eee9c4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To express or imply a negative value judgement of someone to make them desire one's approval, especially when trying to pick up a date."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a2f2cc7-221b-47a7-835e-b243cbd9f1f7",
                                "sense_id": "ad2a4339-6131-32cb-9c7a-53bf31b67c6f",
                                "text": "Women, on the other hand, are wired to believe that men are always ready to reach home base and never turn down a booty opportunity. So when he negs you, it seems unnatural, and you may worry that something’s wrong with your relationship."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ba47686-93a6-4683-98a6-6e0815faf786",
                                "sense_id": "ad2a4339-6131-32cb-9c7a-53bf31b67c6f",
                                "text": "I mean, the thing is, overall you want the chick to feel good about herself around you and because of you. It's true that good negging really helps that, but bad negging--negging where she's already insecure--can kill it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf40ed0e-830f-4245-b963-337fb629ef1e",
                                "sense_id": "ad2a4339-6131-32cb-9c7a-53bf31b67c6f",
                                "text": "She's an 11. This is going to take some hardcore negging."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "921b9134-2a67-3313-b752-bd57ba25d296",
                        "entry_id": "864b074e-bec0-3795-833e-cba914eee9c4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To leave negative feedback about (someone) in a reputation tracking system."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c5831df-6053-4908-bc4b-08cf8c6bb1c3",
                                "sense_id": "921b9134-2a67-3313-b752-bd57ba25d296",
                                "text": "I negged the seller who didn't send me the widget I paid for."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8fc9174a-cce6-4674-b653-da2cc27f3bdd",
                                "sense_id": "921b9134-2a67-3313-b752-bd57ba25d296",
                                "text": "It is important to leave feedback to warn others in serious situations, but it is also smart to consider the long-term consequences of racking up lots of negatives because you ‘negged’ someone over a small oversight or a misunderstanding over a three-dollar item."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8ad6c87-9e67-4fe7-8ca1-3614017dfe5a",
                                "sense_id": "921b9134-2a67-3313-b752-bd57ba25d296",
                                "text": "He left negative feedback (a.k.a. “negging”) and vowed vengeance but the seller just laughed as she negged him back."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "02bbd715-d085-4dfb-ba04-75c599f50e69",
                        "source_entry_id": "864b074e-bec0-3795-833e-cba914eee9c4",
